1. Executive Summary
Project Name: Packet Runner
Genre:
Endless Runner
Educational Game
Cybersecurity Awareness
Target Audience:
Students
Cybersecurity Beginners
TryHackMe Learners
IT Enthusiasts
Secondary School & University Students
Core Vision:
Packet Runner transforms abstract cybersecurity concepts into interactive gameplay.
Players become a data packet traversing networks, making security decisions while avoiding cyber threats.
Instead of reading about phishing or malware, players experience them.
2. Problem Statement
Many people find cybersecurity:
