5. Main Character
The Packet
The player is literally a network packet.
Attributes
Integrity
Confidentiality
Availability
These are the famous CIA Triad concepts disguised as health bars.
Example:
Integrity = Data Accuracy
Confidentiality = Data Privacy
Availability = Ability to Reach Destination
6. Enemies
Malware Bot
Purpose: Teaches malware infections.
Attack: Corrupts packet data.
Phishing Portal
Purpose: Teaches social engineering.
Attack: Tricks player into entering credentials.
DDoS Storm
Purpose: Teaches service disruption.
Attack: Blocks movement.
Packet Sniffer
Purpose: Teaches interception.
Attack: Reads unencrypted traffic.
Ransomware Beast
Purpose: Teaches ransomware.
Attack: Locks progress until solved.
